      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْتُومٌ</span></b>  <i>Reviled, vilified, upbraided, reproached,
defamed,</i> or <i>called by a bad name:</i> and so with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span> applied to a female, as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَتِيمٌ</span></b> ; (K, TA;)
this last, without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>, mentioned on the authority
of Lh. (TA.)

